sequenceDiagram
    participant P1 as iPhone A
    participant P2 as iPhone B
    participant CL as Cloud
    participant C as Companion
    participant S as Source

    P1->>CL: exact APPROVE actionId=A
    P2->>CL: exact REJECT actionId=B
    CL->>C: A
    CL->>C: B
    C->>C: serialize per session / interaction
    C->>C: validate A against current PendingInteraction
    C->>S: resolve APPROVE
    S-->>C: terminal/current result
    C->>C: persist canonical result
    C-->>CL: A = resolved
    C->>C: validate B
    C-->>CL: B = already_resolved / stale
    CL-->>P1: resolved
    CL-->>P2: current terminal result